## Keep Docs in Sync

**IMPORTANT:** Always update documentation as you work.

- When you implement something, update the spec to reflect reality
- When a harness passes, update status in the subsystem spec AND `properties.md`
- When you make architecture decisions, document them in the Decisions table with
  verification impact
- When you add or retire an ID, update `properties.md`
- When you change something that affects other docs, update those too
- Mark spec sections ✅ Complete when implemented and verified

The user may start new sessions and relies on docs being accurate. Stale docs cause
confusion and wasted time. A stale registry is worse: it claims assurance that does not
exist.

